  "notes": [
    "DRAFT: a skeleton from the world database export of map 189 (tools/dungeongen, spec tools/dungeongen/plans.json). The boss order is the usual clear order, the packs are the spawn clusters nearest each boss; walls, doors, stairs and events are unknown to it. Not mapped, not live-checked: do the GM-invisible mapping walk and correct the route before the first run (AUTO-IMPROVE step 0); dungeon_run refuses it without allow_draft.",
    "A wait_for on a door a lever or key opens needs timeout_s 60 (the default): a linked door can open 30 s after the use.",
    "Needs: Houndmaster Loksey's hounds (SPELL_SUMMONSCARLETHOUND)",
    "Needs: Brother Wystan (61983) is a Turtle addition: EventAI, spell list 180317 (Fireball 8402); he patrols (movement_type 2), the boss step meets him on his path",
    "One of four wings of map 189.",
    "Pack census 2026-10-22 (no GM walk: tools/dungeongen/testdata/map189 + sql/base): 86 library spawns (81 trash 33-36 elite, 3 bosses, Brother Wystan patrols his beat x 209.5-232.0 on the upper floor; the Monk 2583271 patrols 220.8 -386.7 to 220.9 -338.5 on and off the upper floor; the Chaplain 40098 patrols 265 -379 to 221.1 -329; the Beastmaster 40068 and his Hound 40070 patrol x 201.2 -232.9 to 201.4 -288; the Gallants 40047 and 40082 patrol the east hall; tracking-hound packs are creature_groups of the Beastmasters and of Loksey). Flees at 15% HP (EventAI): 4287 4288 4291 4296 4299. Casters: 4291 Diviner (Fireball 9053) and 4296 Adept (Heal 6063); the 4299 Chaplain heals (Power Word: Shield 6066, Renew 8362). Wystan's Fireball 8402 casts with a bar (interruptFlags 15, preventionType 1): boss.tactics.interrupt.",
    "Fix round 2026-10-22: Loksey's three Tracking Hounds (creature_groups leader 40088: 40089 40090 40091, at 120.9-123.8 -257.7..-261.4, 3 yd from him) were the pull group at his cage and Wystan's two camp Monks (2583275 2583276 at 208.4 210.9 -404.9..-407.3, 3-4 yd from his spawn point) were a pull group by themselves: both folded into their boss step as boss.first. The patrols named above were added to their pull groups (lg1 group of the 220.82 Monk, lg1 group of the Chaplain 265 -379). Arcanist Doan's two hall packs (40119 40120 and 40121 40122 40123) get radius 9: they are 8 yd apart in one 15 yd chain of 8, Doan stands 25.7 yd from the first stand and his spawn 40124 wanders his room at x 142-148 (4 s waits). The 9 run-leader hop notices and the 220 yd detour at the Diviner pair (216.5 -418.5) stay from plan-check (the walk settles them)."
  ],
